{%- comment -%}
  Snosha — Long Description (product page; Figma desktop 190:10527, mobile 190:11237).
  One section holding a stack of content panels (Intro, Sonic technology, Box contents, …).
  - Panels: private theme block _snosha-ld-panel (add / remove / drag to reorder). Each panel has
    its own layout (text only, three columns, two columns), its own image settings (static child
    block _snosha-ld-media) and its own list rows (_snosha-ld-item).
  - Typography: private static block _snosha-ld-typography (id "typography"). It holds the text
    sizes so this schema stays under Shopify's 40-setting advisory (Theme Check
    ExcessiveSettingsCount). Hiding it falls back to the Figma sizes in assets/main.css.
  - All copy lives in the preset / block settings; nothing product-specific is hardcoded here.
  Styles: assets/main.css (.snosha-long-description); the {% style %} below is the per-instance bridge.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ss = section.settings
-%}

{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .snosha-long-description {
    --snosha-ld-padding-start: {{ ss.padding_top }}px;
    --snosha-ld-padding-end: {{ ss.padding_bottom }}px;
    --snosha-ld-padding-start-mobile: {{ ss.padding_top_mobile }}px;
    --snosha-ld-padding-end-mobile: {{ ss.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    --snosha-ld-panel-gap: {{ ss.panel_gap }}px;
    --snosha-ld-panel-gap-mobile: {{ ss.panel_gap_mobile }}px;
    --snosha-ld-bg-start: {{ ss.background_start }};
    --snosha-ld-bg-end: {{ ss.background_end }};
    --snosha-ld-heading-color: {{ ss.heading_color }};
    --snosha-ld-accent-text-color: {{ ss.accent_text_color }};
    --snosha-ld-body-color: {{ ss.body_color }};
    --snosha-ld-item-title-color: {{ ss.item_title_color }};
    --snosha-ld-item-desc-color: {{ ss.item_desc_color }};
    --snosha-ld-icon-color: {{ ss.icon_color }};
    --snosha-ld-icon-accent: {{ ss.icon_accent_color }};
    --snosha-ld-tile-bg: {{ ss.tile_color }};
    --snosha-ld-tile-border: {{ ss.tile_border_color }};
    --snosha-ld-tile-shadow: {{ ss.tile_shadow_color }};
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="snosha-long-description{% if ss.custom_class != blank %} {{ ss.custom_class | escape }}{% endif %}">
  {% content_for 'block', type: '_snosha-ld-typography', id: 'typography' %}
  <div class="section section--page-width section--mobile-full-width">
    <div class="snosha-long-description__panels">
      {% content_for 'blocks' %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

